msgstr "第三方 Python 插件"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:120
msgid ""
"To install and manage your plugins, visit the :ref:"
"`krita_python_plugin_howto` area. See the second area on how to get Krita to "
"recognize your plugin."
msgstr ""
"如需安装和管理你的插件，可查阅 :ref:`krita_python_plugin_howto` 页面的第二小"
"节“让 Krita 识别你的插件”。"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:125
msgid "Usability"
msgstr "工具易用性插件"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:126
msgid "Direct Eraser Plugin"
msgstr "Direct Eraser - 直接橡皮擦"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:128
msgid ""
"https://www.mediafire.com/file/sotzc2keogz0bor/Krita+Direct+Eraser+Plugin.zip"
msgstr ""
"https://www.mediafire.com/file/sotzc2keogz0bor/Krita+Direct+Eraser+Plugin.zip"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:130
msgid ""
"ThreeSlots plugin: creates three brushtool shortcuts that memorize last used "
"brush preset for each slot independently from each other."
msgstr ""
"ThreeSlots - 三组独立预设快捷键：创建三个手绘笔刷工具的快捷键，每一个都会独立"
"记忆自己的最近工具和预设。"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:132
msgid "https://github.com/DarkDefender/threeslots"
msgstr "https://github.com/DarkDefender/threeslots"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:134
msgid "QuickColor: shortcuts to get a color from a specified palette"
msgstr "QuickColor - 快速颜色切换：从特定色板中快速切换颜色的快捷键插件"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:136
msgid "https://github.com/JonasLW/QuickColor"
msgstr "https://github.com/JonasLW/QuickColor"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:138
msgid ""
"BrushColorSwitch: switches brush and foreground/background color with the "
"same action/shortcut."
msgstr ""
"BrushColorSwitch - 笔刷与颜色同时切换：用同一个操作/快捷键切换笔刷预设和前景"
"色/背景色。"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:140
msgid "https://github.com/rkspsm/BrushColorSwitch"
msgstr "https://github.com/rkspsm/BrushColorSwitch"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:142
msgid "Tablet Controls Docker"
msgstr "Tablet Controls Docker - 数位板按钮工具面板"

