msgid ""
"ToggleRefLayer: enables you to assign a keyboard shortcut to toggle the "
"visibility of a reference layer named \"reference\""
msgstr ""
"ToggleRefLayer - 参考图层快速切换：指定一个键盘快捷键用于快速显示/隐藏名"
"为“reference”的参考图像图层。"

