"Shotgun Toolkit Engine for Krita: allows working in a managed way, loading/"
"saving/publishing artwork, keeping it up to date and publishing your "
"projects and layers into Shotgun"
msgstr ""
"Shotgun Toolkit Engine for Krita - Shotgun 套件整合：与 Shotgun 创意流程管理"
"套件进行整合，包括图像、图层的读取、载入、同步、出版等方面。"

