#: ../../resources_page.rst:205
msgid ""
"Subwindow organizer: split screen, adjusting to window size changes, "
"snapping to workspace borders and more."
msgstr ""
"Subwindow organizer - 子窗口管理器：分屏、按照窗口大小变化调整、吸附到工作区"
"边缘和更多功能。"

