msgid "https://github.com/wojtryb/kritaSubwindowOrganizer"
msgstr "https://github.com/wojtryb/kritaSubwindowOrganizer"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:210
msgid ""
"KanvasBuddy: a small dialog that floats on top of the canvas packed with "
"enough features to let you spend as much time in Canvas-Only mode as "
"possible. The idea behind KB was to provide the 20% of tools used 80% of the "
"time in the most out-of-the-way GUI possible."
msgstr ""
"KanvasBuddy - 画布助手：在画布视图上显示一个小型的浮动对话框，在隐藏所有面板"
"模式下以最少干扰的形式提供 80% 情况下面都会用到的 20% 的功能。"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:213
msgid ""
"Source, main page and download link: https://github.com/Kapyia/KanvasBuddy"
msgstr "项目主页、源代码和下载：https://github.com/Kapyia/KanvasBuddy"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:215
msgid ""
"Krita-artists thread: https://krita-artists.org/t/kanvasbuddy-a-minimalist-"
"toolbar/549"
msgstr ""
"Krita 国际论坛主题帖：https://krita-artists.org/t/kanvasbuddy-a-minimalist-"
"toolbar/549"

